borg-type-genericNS-name = Generic
borg-type-genericNS-desc = Jack of all trades, master of none. Do various random station tasks, or maybe help out the science department that built you.
borg-type-genericNS-transponder = Generic Cyborg

borg-type-engineeringNS-name = Engineering
borg-type-engineeringNS-desc = Assist the engineering team in station construction, repairing damage, or fixing electrical and atmospheric issues.
borg-type-engineeringNS-transponder = Engineering Cyborg

borg-type-janitorNS-name = Janitor
borg-type-janitorNS-desc = Keep the station nice and tidy, clean up spills, collect and properly dispose of trash left around by lazy crewmembers.
borg-type-janitorNS-transponder = Janitor Cyborg

borg-type-medicalNS-name = Medical
borg-type-medicalNS-desc = Provide medical attention to crew who need it, either in medbay or in hazardous areas conventional paramedics cannot reach.
borg-type-medicalNS-transponder = Medical Cyborg

borg-type-serviceNS-name = Service
borg-type-serviceNS-desc = Help out with a wide range of crew services, ranging from serving snacks and drinks to botany to entertainment.
borg-type-serviceNS-transponder = Service Cyborg

borg-type-securityNS-name = Security
borg-type-securityNS-desc = Assist the security team in maintaining order on the station, apprehending criminals, and responding to threats.
borg-type-securityNS-transponder = Security Cyborg

borg-type-purrfusNS-name = Purrfus
borg-type-purrfusNS-desc = Serve as a personal aid for those who require assistance with paperwork, especially members of command and the law department.
borg-type-purrfusNS-transponder = Purrfus Cyborg

